{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "364fb34853f884b6a20f0e0e75eda7f70e37772b6f9638d1cc7e3d74c7efdac7", "ja": "（今日は、百合子の宣材写真撮影……。\nなんだか青い顔をしてるみたいだけど、大丈夫かな）", "zh": "（今天要拍百合子的宣传照……\n看她脸色似乎有点苍白，不晓得要不要紧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "a55213c0e7ea0c6ed9fc0ec0ffc15c8621d52520050c67e48085f1635d7153ca", "ja": "ほっ……本日はどうぞっ、\nよ、よ、よろしくお願いしますっ……！", "zh": "今……今天请、\n多、多、多多指教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1002_camman", "source_sha256": "b3eb3dda356b4a3fb229495b1543b1db84f62e3985c51944ce6e60ce80d7b788", "ja": "……だいぶ緊張してますね。\n肩の力を抜いて、リラックスしてくださいね！", "zh": "……我看你好像很紧张呢。\n肩膀别那么僵硬，放松点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "11e34a128f5661510402915e683a0977a8cb9301f0ddd01dba421f246cf287c1", "ja": "は、はいっ……！　り、リラッ……クス……\nふぅぅ……、リラッ……クス……っ！", "zh": "好、好的……！快、快放……松……\n呼……快放……松……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "1fed235d758b89dfe89f1c5caac6f45df39c7a943502720cc71ac235e3468806", "ja": "どうですか、{$P$}さん。\nわ、私、リラックス……で、できて、ますか？？", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}先生。\n我、我有……放、放松吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "55fb2607532854ba448d3f6b21b5487bc527c9365ce57c01fe422cdf6ee39c24", "ja": "わかった、焦らずにいこう。\n気を楽に……まずはカメラを忘れて、深呼吸だ。", "zh": "这样吧，你别急。\n缓和一下情绪……先把摄影机给忘掉，来深呼吸吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "85186abed02897742cef65201109bf62629aab3da61656f123008165b6797978", "ja": "や、やっぱり、できてないんですね！？", "zh": "我、我果然失败了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "f2bd3e28314d854d30799c0abd2d531cec5b2c3ea14f9dcb0668c8b73bd0b621", "ja": "うう……今まで本で読んだ、ありとあらゆる\nリラックス方法を試してみたんですけど……。", "zh": "呜呜……虽然已经试遍了\n在书上看过的放松方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2e6b8f64e1e8a302d9510dc6a2f73bc22ad2dd680e65fd737287fb854a32d1d", "ja": "緊張しちゃいけない！って思えば思うほど、\n顔や体が強張ってきちゃって……ううっ。", "zh": "但越是想着「不可以紧张！」\n表情跟身体就越僵硬……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0c9fb24460d870f935711505964d3a34b23e54280c69ad3cf6eb24d1b9859a2d", "ja": "一度リセットするには……。\nそうだな、好きな本を読んでみたらどうだ？", "zh": "转换情绪的方法……\n对了，看看你喜欢的书如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "cc70417887cfc89c136be7fc1746a86f53d058947b22f55ab77a153773704346", "ja": "でも私、今読んでる小説に、ドはまりしてるので……\n戻ってこれなくなっちゃいますよ……？", "zh": "可是最近看的小说让我很入迷……\n我怕开始看之后就回不来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3c2fd6395c1a495bc9e32a0c699c9ce05b7db41e363640668852705209603c10", "ja": "そ、そうか……それは困るな。\nなら、その小説の感想を、俺に話してみるとか？", "zh": "是、是吗……那就伤脑筋了。\n那么，要不要试着跟我聊聊你对那本小说的感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2ae5722705f5be5f1c3f4dcd925b8d5bd16508460aaf55e9a83b7702781d7042", "ja": "好きな本の話をすれば、\n適度にリラックスできるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "聊聊喜欢的书，\n应该能适度放松吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "a86f8943f48ee6adc84e62895fb792f2d4ea85f5eb280f2ebeac6116276f1a5c", "ja": "なるほど……。\nじゃあ、やってみます！", "zh": "原来如此……\n那我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "706ee71c2a9ccf61d6bf97ccb9d5923f9d8ce32c13987f0ab76dbf5f2ece0f46", "ja": "今読んでいるのは、いわゆる貴種流離譚ものです！\n亡国の王子が、家臣と各地を旅しているんですけど……", "zh": "我最近在看所谓的颠沛奋斗史！\n是亡国王子和家臣到各地旅行的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "484d66012024efc22ca85884deba26d8bed0013bb59bf820380cbf2ee9efc1f1", "ja": "とある山では、盗賊団が仲間になり。美しい港町では、\nなんと生き別れの双子の妹に巡り会ったり……。", "zh": "他们爬上某座山时，和盗贼团成为了伙伴。\n来到美丽港口时，居然还和失散的双胞胎妹妹重逢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "958d9b934785adc05f8a910899deafc716f55d7b1d0db8d55a17646bed62dcc4", "ja": "おお……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "27c3c05bd6a483424c25ae69b4f39a9d11fd01df2bbf021de68dcc2b83e1674b", "ja": "（生き生きとして、いい表情だ。\nよし、今のうちにカメラマンさんに……）", "zh": "（这表情充满活力，太棒了。\n好，趁现在请摄影师拍下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f76272895a60d56147107d910aac7d14792998a5d498084166446d627b97328", "ja": "今日読んだところも、圧巻でした！　以前助けた竜が、\n主人公のピンチを助けに来てくれるんです！", "zh": "我今天看到的段落也很精彩！\n主角以前帮助过的龙，前来拯救了陷入危机的主角！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "17b3a54bb9a19742a3568c3e460ebab2e3ad10aed12e798c511f17c451d93329", "ja": "夕暮れの大空に、竜の大きな翼が広がって……！\nああ、あの景色！　まるで、目に浮かぶよう……。", "zh": "在染上暮色的天空中展开的硕大龙翼……！\n啊啊，那副景色仿佛就近在眼前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1020_camman", "source_sha256": "88df7d68ae4e8607b14254c908923617cbd4c9879c142546d8920b82bf45a10d", "ja": "……ハイ、とびきりの笑顔いただきました！\nこれはいい宣材写真になりますよ！", "zh": "……很好，拍到了灿烂的笑容！\n这会是很棒的宣传照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "847b94ad93d28fc46532f775b73b9ed2bfe61d1f7fa7f483591368255456dbbe", "ja": "えっ？\n……い、いつの間に撮ってたんですか！？", "zh": "咦？\n……什、什么时候拍的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f3892896fab49ace09314593e80a6dbf09035457c1d82db45ac4ebbfc50f192c", "ja": "まぁまぁ、撮れたんだからいいじゃないか。\nうん、いい写真だ！", "zh": "别放在心上，有拍到照片不是很好吗？\n嗯，真是张好照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3d18cf80175388ddf5d8b722d6e4a1e2150995ea584bf76c4dcc06fcce1047d", "ja": "あっ……うそ。\n私、こんな楽しそうな顔、できたんだ……。", "zh": "啊……不会吧，\n我居然能摆出这么开心的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ae9fb332f981462dac6c3491a006a9a3fdf99009d278965d0a209f5dabbe766c", "ja": "自分では、なかなか気づけないだろうけど。\nすごくいい笑顔だと思うぞ！", "zh": "虽然你本身可能不容易察觉，\n但我觉得这是很棒的笑容喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "64adc13c92a2f52f7cd499d31d31830d3fdcf2175cbc2268b8a4340e526bd857", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n素敵な宣材写真を、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢谢你帮我拍出这么棒的宣传照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8b38de5306c05526caa50148986c62f3d7aa2285fc817189d9c7ee332b661bcc", "ja": "（写真の中には、気持ちを伝えようと夢中になっている\n少女の姿。……たくさんの人の目を奪いそうだ！）", "zh": "（照片里映照着少女侃侃而谈的身影……\n应该能吸引许多人的目光！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
